    "// career-timeline.json - events shown on the My Journey timeline.",
    "// schemaVersion: always 1. It tells the loader which shape to expect; do not change it.",
    "// section: heading text plus on/off switches for search, filters, sorting and detail views.",
    "// Each event points at a record in another dataset; the section reads that record's title and text.",
    "// REQUIRED per event: id, type, referenceId, date.",
    "// id: unique and stable, prefix event- (event-001).",
    "// type: one of experience, project, certificate, education, learning.",
    "// referenceId: id of the record, e.g. project-001 or exp-001. It must exist.",
    "// date / endDate: YYYY, YYYY-MM or YYYY-MM-DD. An event without a valid date is skipped.",
    "// featured: true emphasises the marker. order: manual position.",
    "// enabled: false hides the event.",
    "// eventTypes[] below controls the filter labels; keep the five ids above."
  ],
